# Stage 2 proof separate from the saved melee baseline. No models or external AI.
# Short native duel = 30 substeps. The following probes freeze only these bench-owned actors.
# Failure emits body_probe_error. Every vision case must be in native range; occlusion needs
# BOTH target-center and target-head world collision rays. LEVELUP.WAV retains its true duration.
set time 12 0
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
turn 210
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
immortal player on
release all
bodyduel 17 1000
wait 5000
bodyprobe visible
bodyprobe sound_end
bodyprobe occluded
bodyprobe sound_end
